	)
	(text
		"USB-C READOUT"
		(at 439.0461 60.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				bold
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4f3b5b69-e3d8-5c39-a7dd-5552a98efa08")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 18.79 222.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "170b2628-c65f-5738-998f-2f06426d6089")
	)
	(text
		"J2 pin 1 F+, pin 2 S+, pin 3 S-, pin 4 F-. PT100 4-wire; force pair carries the 1 mA IDAC current, sense pair reads the RTD."
		(at 18.79 226.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e4d963bb-f779-50a3-b493-855106485d8c")
	)
	(text
		"R_S1/R_S2 1k with C_D 100nF across the pair and C_CM1/C_CM2 10nF to GND: differential corner 1/(2pi*2k*110nF) about 720 Hz, common-mode corner about 16 kHz."
		(at 18.79 228.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "15d80c8a-ea7b-5ece-827e-39873b251657")
	)
	(text
		"C_D is 10x each C_CM so a capacitor mismatch turns into little differential error (TI input filter rule). C0G so the filter does not move the reading."
		(at 18.79 231.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5b119c5d-aa35-5938-9be3-87abf50f378e")
	)
	(text
		"C_F 10nF decouples the force node F+ (IDAC output). R_BIAS 1k returns the IDAC current to GND and lifts the RTD common-mode to about 1.1 V."
		(at 18.79 233.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2dea9e63-7c37-5f2e-9d6f-e89452286805")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 17.87 123.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1e4136da-eadb-5781-907d-5aab60ed50c0")
	)
	(text
		"AVDD from +3V3A (ferrite-filtered), DVDD and IOVDD from +3V3. AVSS, AVSS_SW, REFN0, REFCOM, the exposed pad and DGND (pin 14) are on GND: the ADC returns its own digital supply current to the same plane. CLK is tied to that ground to use the internal oscillator."
		(at 17.87 127.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9f055ceb-4e6d-52ac-a4f0-ce5c1f03dc33")
	)
	(text
		"REFOUT has 1 uF to GND for the unused internal reference. RESET has a 10k pull-up to +3V3 and is also driven by the MCU."
		(at 17.87 129.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "92fd1443-400e-55f7-8a2f-06910b66d25d")
	)
	(text
		"AINCOM, AIN3..AIN11, REFP1/REFN1, GPIOs and pin 25 are left open."
		(at 17.87 132.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a1b9bca0-0447-50da-b1df-5b6e47082366")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 396.94 224.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0de13d2c-c503-5df8-9cd5-e66c92ca9234")
	)
	(text
		"REF5025 2.5 V, VIN from +3V3A, VOUT straight to REFP0 with 1 uF at the reference pin, GND to GND. TEMP, TRIM/NR, DNC and NC pins are open."
		(at 396.94 228.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0a9028ca-8118-5145-8eb9-33c9747fff4d")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 332.73 44.91 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "51658b92-cd79-5002-ab0c-0feca0477cc9")
	)
	(text
		"L2 filters +3V3 into the +3V3A analog rail for the ADC and the reference. Its DC resistance and the ADC/REF supply current are not computed here."
		(at 332.73 48.91 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a2f9716f-a888-507d-9a27-85b2919be4be")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 17.28 358.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4b6a2cbf-d737-5b06-991b-c0de7e3f999b")
	)
	(text
		"RP2350 runs from its on-chip regulator: VREG_VIN on +3V3, VREG_LX through L1 3.3uH to the 1.1 V DVDD net, VREG_FB on that net."
		(at 17.28 362.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b356831f-fcf2-57e2-b0ff-75d89d689d7c")
	)
	(text
		"VREG_AVDD and ADC_AVDD are fed from +3V3 through R_AV 33R and C_AVF 4.7uF."
		(at 17.28 364.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "55159f9f-eba5-516b-a9b7-2980949982b8")
	)
	(text
		"U4 W25Q128 on the QSPI pins is the boot flash. Y1 ECS-120-20-33-TR 12 MHz, CL 20 pF: 2x 33 pF load caps (33/2 + about 3 pF stray = 19.5 pF), R_X 1k on XOUT."
		(at 17.28 367.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c2690454-b940-5c6e-8795-1bb87707f7e4")
	)
	(text
		"J3 SWD: pin 1 SWCLK, pin 2 SWDIO, pin 3 GND. RUN has a 10k pull-up to +3V3."
		(at 17.28 369.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "17b5602d-d445-53b2-80f5-ab5b7c50483b")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 333.51 152.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cc4f1a5a-9e91-5084-8574-6e4d4ecdd04d")
	)
	(text
		"USB 2.0 device port, VBUS 5 V in. CC1/CC2 5.1k so a host sources 5 V. 27R series on D+/D-, ESD diodes at the connector."
		(at 333.51 156.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ec94afbb-6387-52ec-879c-58a982086cbc")
	)
	(text
		"VBUS feeds U5 LP5907-3.3 (250 mA) which makes the +3V3 digital rail. No VBUS fuse or TVS: see QUALIFICATION.md."
		(at 333.51 158.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6d1b74f6-d36f-5a86-a343-ed85347d6843")
	)
	(text
		"The RTD board is a bus-powered USB device: it draws a few tens of mA. No USB-C PD."
		(at 333.51 161.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "edb07e24-032a-5fb6-a7cc-ff08eb63eeba")
	)
